        "description": "SelectSaleOrder - Complex filtered search for sale orders\n\nThis endpoint implements the .NET SelectSaleOrder method with dynamic filtering.\n\nSupported Filters:\n- Comid (Company ID) - REQUIRED\n- Id (Customer ID)\n- JId (Job Master ID)\n- Employeeid (Employee ID with DashboardStatus for hierarchy)\n- Statusid (Single Status ID)\n- statusList (Comma-separated status IDs)\n- completestatusnotshow (Exclude completed status=8)\n- Search (Bill/Invoice number search)\n- Remarks (1=non-empty, 2=empty)\n- Offvesselname (Loading vessel name search)\n- Loadingvesselname (Off-loading vessel name search)\n- Fromdate (Start date YYYY/MM/DD)\n- Todate (End date YYYY/MM/DD)\n- ETA (Use ETA filters)\n- ETAType (1=OETA, 2=ETA, 3=Both)\n- Pickup (Use pickup date)\n- Invoice (Search in invoice)\n- DashboardStatus (0=simple, 2=with subordinates)\n\nReturns:\n{\n  \"IsSuccess\": true,\n  \"StatusCode\": 200,\n  \"Message\": \"Success\",\n  \"Data1\": {\n    \"salemaster\": [master records],\n    \"saledetails\": [detail records]\n  }\n}"
